    {
      "id": "3032bc58-de2f-44a6-bf04-1bf27e614ebe",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "blue",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 2,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your Mission for THE LAST SPRINT OF THIS TERM!",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "57523346-6643-4963-b726-bde4349fe1bb",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is the last sprint of the term! Soon your product will be put through its paces at Technigala! A working, testable demo is the requirement. ",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "73d3562b-1e6c-4ee7-89b5-8b856d2bcb90",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This will be your opportunity to test your product and get feedback, so have a testing plan in place. Don’t worry about other documentation until ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "after",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " demos.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c6492de5-3ea9-4d59-83ab-239bf461b457",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "blue",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 2,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Testing Plan",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "f0ef1408-2e6d-4fef-8e96-918cf18bf675",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In preparation for the DEMOs at the end of Term 1, we will need a plan! You should consider the demos as your final exam for the term, and it is worth a ton of points. This is the moment you are working up to — your time to shine. During the expo you will present your work to various people, including your instructor.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "73a064bb-536c-4cf0-9801-ce041ea12b98",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "So, are there any assumptions about your product that you might want to test?",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2d761daf-d3da-438f-801f-a0070d2f197f",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🚀 Create an Issue ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Term 1 Testing Plan",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " and write down a testing plan. This is not a long document - terse but thoughtful is good.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "66d0352f-78b2-4628-8ba5-7ca7fbd435ed",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "List the features you want people to try out during the demos.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "d91516c2-47e7-4110-b30b-5234ba0968be",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How will you measure their feedback?",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "9ba826e2-221b-4ce1-9e8b-92601989a1e6",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How will you validate your approach?",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
